# The slim store is no longer committed — it is published as a GitHub Release
# asset (tag slim-store) and downloaded at startup, so the repo does not grow by
# ~38MB a trading day. data/slim_version.txt is the tiny marker whose daily change
# triggers a redeploy. See idxcore/store/db.ensure_slim_store + scripts/publish_slim.ps1.
data/idx_slim.duckdb
data/*.part
data/*.version
.gstack/
